Package: tlosint-sherlock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: Hunt down social media accounts by username
 Sherlock searches a large number of social networks for a given username.
 .
 Ships a self-contained virtualenv under /opt/tracelabs/sherlock so its
 dependency pins cannot collide with other OSINT tools on the system.
